      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently toss the avocado with the cucumber mixture. Refrigerate mixture 10 minutes more. Remove from the refrigerator, and drain. Remove and discard garlic. Toss the cucumber mixture again with the red wine vinegar.",
